# The suppressions `maak rpm-build' hands to rpmlint with -r, so the gate runs
# with the project's own judgement rather than the distribution's defaults.
# A filter is a decision, so each one says why it is here; the spec is expected
# to be clean without one.

# The suite is not a %check: it needs guile-veritas, which no distribution
# carries yet, and the Arch recipe and CI run it from the checkout instead.
addFilter("no-%check-section")
